{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Wrapped in cloth and [G]laid in hay
[Em]There was no [A]room for us to [D]stay
The shepherds came and [G]knelt to see
[Em]The baby [A]sleeping close [D]to me
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Hush now, hush now, [G]little King
The [A]angels told me [D]everything
[Dmaj7/C#]And [Bm]I will [F#m]keep these [G]things and [D/F#]ponder
[Em]In my [A]heart, in my [D][G]heart
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]They told of angels [G]in the sky
[Em]Of glory [A]sung to God [D]on high
And all who heard it [G]were amazed
[Em]Now sleep while [A]heaven gives [D]you praise
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Hush now, hush now, [G]little King
The [A]angels told me [D]everything
[A/C#]And [Bm]I will [F#m]keep these [G]things and [D/F#]ponder
